1
00:00:18,679 --> 00:00:19,199
Let's go.

2
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,120
Come on.

3
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,399
I haven't had a full meal in three days.

4
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,119
Tastes just like childhood.

5
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:40,439
Delicious.

6
00:00:41,439 --> 00:00:41,960
Wan Jun.

7
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,240
Why don't you tell us?

8
00:00:46,719 --> 00:00:47,880
What did you see that night?

9
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:54,880
That night...

10
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,359
I'd had a few drinks.

11
00:00:58,479 --> 00:00:59,520
On my way home,

12
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,200
I ran into a bunch of suspicious people.

13
00:01:03,079 --> 00:01:05,000
They killed over a dozen people in one go.

14
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:07,040
I thought that was the end of it.

15
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:08,879
Little did I know, they...

16
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,680
Did you see what the killer looked like?

17
00:01:29,519 --> 00:01:30,599
It was dark and foggy.

18
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:33,359
Just that he was really tall.

19
00:01:34,319 --> 00:01:35,439
Shen Tieshan...

20
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:37,000
Why was he chasing you?

21
00:01:37,439 --> 00:01:40,040
I borrowed money from him to buy a new boat.

22
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:42,680
And I haven't paid him back yet.

23
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,519
Come to me if you ever need money in the future.

24
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:50,519
Really?

25
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,159
Really.

26
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,120
Brothers are the only ones you can count on.

27
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:58,640
Since we ran into each other today,

28
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,760
let's... have a drink.

29
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:04,280
Let's drink!

30
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:06,280
Waiter!

31
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:06,879
Bring us a pot of wine!

32
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:07,359
Coming right up!

33
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,759
Cheers! Cheers! Cheers!

34
00:02:24,319 --> 00:02:25,599
You can't blame me for this.

35
00:02:26,599 --> 00:02:27,599
You brought this on yourselves.

36
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,039
That should be enough, right?

37
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:38,000
White pill or red pill?

38
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:39,960
Red! The red pill.

39
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:50,960
I'll take this for now.

40
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,639
How come you're fine?

41
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,199
We knew you were up to something.

42
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,360
I...

43
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,680
We kept the wine in our mouths

44
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:13,639
and secretly spat it out.

45
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:14,639
We didn't swallow a drop.

46
00:03:15,719 --> 00:03:17,000
Wan Jun, oh Wan Jun...

47
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,199
Look at you.

48
00:03:19,439 --> 00:03:20,479
Shen Tieshan is nothing but

49
00:03:20,479 --> 00:03:21,639
a stingy miser.

50
00:03:22,199 --> 00:03:23,840
There's no way he'd lend you money

51
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,639
to buy any boat.

52
00:03:24,639 --> 00:03:25,360
Did you know?

53
00:03:26,199 --> 00:03:27,719
Most of the victims drowned.

54
00:03:28,039 --> 00:03:29,199
You said they were stabbed to death,

55
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:30,360
but that doesn't match the cause of death.

56
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,479
What's that in your hand?

57
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:32,879
Hand it over.

58
00:03:33,319 --> 00:03:33,800
No!

59
00:03:34,319 --> 00:03:35,000
This is my treasure!

60
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:35,960
None of you can take it!

61
00:03:36,479 --> 00:03:37,080
Your treasure?

62
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:39,240
You stole our money!

63
00:03:39,439 --> 00:03:40,000
Give it here!

64
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:40,479
No!

65
00:03:45,879 --> 00:03:47,080
Let's see what treasure

66
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,280
made you betray your brothers

67
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,000
and abandon your home.

68
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:53,919
It's sugar-coated on the outside.

69
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:03,439
Raw opium.

70
00:04:06,879 --> 00:04:08,840
The Charity Opium Cessation Clinic isn't selling cessation pills,

71
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,520
but raw opium, right?

72
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,400
Give me back the red pill! Give it back!

73
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,039
The murders at Sea Goddess Temple...

74
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,240
Are they connected to raw opium?

75
00:04:22,839 --> 00:04:26,560
The killer scooped out their organs

76
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:30,160
to pack raw opium inside!

77
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,439
Li Mingyuan! Li Mingyuan!

78
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:40,959
Let me out!

79
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,480
I really don't want to be locked up here!

80
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,079
You stole someone else's property

81
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,040
and were caught red-handed.

82
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:48,360
I'm detaining you by law.

83
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,519
Just let me have one puff!

84
00:04:49,879 --> 00:04:51,079
Just one puff, Mingyuan!

85
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,040
I... right now...

86
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,720
I'll... I'll get down on my knees!

87
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,560
I'm begging on my knees, Mingyuan!

88
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,240
You're my lifesaver, Mingyuan!

89
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,120
Focus on getting clean.

90
00:05:07,279 --> 00:05:08,120
Once you recover,

91
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:10,439
I'll take you home.

92
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:12,360
Mingyuan!

93
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,759
Mingyuan!

94
00:05:19,759 --> 00:05:20,439
What are you doing?

95
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:25,319
The Charity Opium Cessation Clinic uses cessation pills

96
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,000
as a front to sell raw opium.

97
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,079
This is a setup!

98
00:05:28,079 --> 00:05:29,040
We've been framed!

99
00:05:29,319 --> 00:05:30,279
Whether it's true or false,

100
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:31,399
we'll find out once we search.

101
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:32,319
Search the place!

102
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,360
Yes, sir!

103
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,639
Officer Li, am I wrong?

104
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,680
Mine is a legitimate business.

105
00:05:55,839 --> 00:05:57,120
We don't do illegal business.

106
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,199
Where are the red cessation pills?

107
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,240
What red cessation pills?

108
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:03,480
Our clinic doesn't have such things.

109
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,160
Officer Li,

110
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,120
your reckless raid today...

111
00:06:07,639 --> 00:06:09,120
I will report this to the police station!

112
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,920
and have the chief see justice done!

113
00:06:11,519 --> 00:06:11,920
You!

114
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:16,959
Haven't I told you before?

115
00:06:17,759 --> 00:06:19,279
Stop causing trouble!

116
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,560
I have witnesses and physical evidence!

117
00:06:21,079 --> 00:06:21,720
Then tell me,

118
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,279
what did you actually find?

119
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:26,480
Shipboard Guild, Sanshan Gang, Opium Cessation Clinic...

120
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:27,519
Just tell me,

121
00:06:27,639 --> 00:06:29,040
who else are you going to cross next?

122
00:06:29,439 --> 00:06:30,639
The clinic moved the raw opium.

123
00:06:30,839 --> 00:06:32,000
They must've been tipped off in advance!

124
00:06:32,439 --> 00:06:33,199
I suspect

125
00:06:34,199 --> 00:06:35,279
someone in the department leaked the info.

126
00:06:35,759 --> 00:06:36,879
What? Are you...

127
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:38,680
going after our own department now?

128
00:06:39,279 --> 00:06:40,199
Gonna investigate our chief next?

129
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:43,959
Come in!

130
00:06:46,959 --> 00:06:47,560
Deputy Chief Zhou.

131
00:06:48,399 --> 00:06:49,160
Starting today,

132
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:51,199
you take charge of the Sea Goddess Temple murder case.

133
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:54,759
Li Mingyuan,

134
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:56,480
you are suspended pending investigation!

135
00:07:01,439 --> 00:07:02,439
I'm so furious! So furious!

136
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:04,040
I'm so furious!

137
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:07,240
Come here. Take your time.

138
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:15,240
Li Mingyuan raided the clinic with his men,

139
00:07:15,759 --> 00:07:16,480
found no raw opium,

140
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,439
and got himself suspended!

141
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,480
We were just one step away from the truth.

142
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,199
Now look at this!

143
00:07:20,279 --> 00:07:21,040
He tipped them off.

144
00:07:21,199 --> 00:07:22,680
All our plans have to start from scratch!

145
00:07:27,399 --> 00:07:28,319
I actually think

146
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,800
Mingyuan's move

147
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,920
has brought you one step closer to the truth.

148
00:07:35,879 --> 00:07:36,480
What do you mean?

149
00:07:37,639 --> 00:07:38,319
You both know

150
00:07:38,319 --> 00:07:40,000
the killer staged the Sea Goddess Temple murder

151
00:07:40,199 --> 00:07:41,399
in order to smuggle raw opium.

152
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,319
They went to such great lengths

153
00:07:43,319 --> 00:07:44,680
to bring the raw opium into Rongcheng.

154
00:07:45,399 --> 00:07:47,000
They have to sell it to recoup their costs.

155
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:49,720
Mingyuan shut down their front at the clinic,

156
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:54,079
so they're bound to seek new underground buyers.

157
00:07:54,399 --> 00:07:55,120
Doing that, however,

158
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,680
is like searching for a needle in a haystack.

159
00:07:57,879 --> 00:07:59,319
If you can't go after them,

160
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,680
then let them come to you.

161
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:16,480
Can I have a puff?

162
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:24,800
Got any opium?

163
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,480
I'll pay you.

164
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,079
No.

165
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:41,120
I've got money.

166
00:08:49,039 --> 00:08:50,120
You want opium?

167
00:08:53,559 --> 00:08:54,240
Got cash?

168
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:56,559
You have...

169
00:08:57,679 --> 00:08:58,440
...opium?

170
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,879
My stuff is straight from the imperial palace.

171
00:09:03,279 --> 00:09:06,480
Money's the last thing I'm short of.

172
00:09:07,039 --> 00:09:07,600
Follow me.

173
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:16,879
We're here.

174
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,480
Just go in through here.

175
00:09:35,039 --> 00:09:36,399
Welcome, honored guest.

176
00:09:36,799 --> 00:09:37,960
How should I address you?

177
00:09:40,759 --> 00:09:42,639
The name is Wang.

178
00:09:43,919 --> 00:09:44,759
Boss Wang.

179
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:46,279
This way, please.

180
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:18,159
Father, why do we bow to him?

181
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,919
Governor Lin led the Destruction of Opium at Humen.

182
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,279
His contributions were immense;

183
00:10:22,879 --> 00:10:24,960
he is a great hero of our nation.

184
00:10:25,519 --> 00:10:28,120
I specially hired the finest master craftsman

185
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:31,000
to create this Shoushan stone carving.

186
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:32,919
We bow before it every day,

187
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:35,480
hoping he will bless our Lian family.

188
00:10:35,919 --> 00:10:37,559
You must also harbor grand ambitions:

189
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:39,840
Were it to benefit my country, I'd lay down my life;

190
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:42,679
why should I shy away from it out of fear of misfortune?

191
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:44,720
Boss Wang.

192
00:10:45,519 --> 00:10:46,080
Boss Wang.

193
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:49,399
What is it?

194
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:56,639
This statue...

195
00:10:57,519 --> 00:10:58,759
is quite interesting.

196
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:16,679
Good eye, Boss Wang!

197
00:11:17,039 --> 00:11:19,679
This Shoushan stone carving has quite a history.

198
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:22,240
Originally, this Shoushan stone carving

199
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:25,000
was enshrined by the former president of the Rongcheng Chamber of Commerce,

200
00:11:25,159 --> 00:11:27,320
in Lian Shanquan's ancestral hall.

201
00:11:28,399 --> 00:11:30,360
Lian Shanquan crossed our big boss

202
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,279
and ran out of luck.

203
00:11:31,799 --> 00:11:33,399
Lian Shanquan, his wife,

204
00:11:33,399 --> 00:11:36,720
and their youngest son were in a car crash.

205
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:39,039
The couple's bodies were never recovered,

206
00:11:39,039 --> 00:11:40,720
and the young boy vanished.

207
00:11:40,799 --> 00:11:42,240
Without a head of the household,

208
00:11:42,399 --> 00:11:43,519
the Lian family quickly fell apart.

209
00:11:44,039 --> 00:11:46,080
Our big boss seized the chance

210
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:48,399
and smoothly got this Shoushan stone carving

211
00:11:48,399 --> 00:11:49,080
into his hands.

212
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:52,080
How tragic.

213
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,480
They had it coming.

214
00:11:53,879 --> 00:11:55,480
If he'd just complied with our big boss,

215
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,679
none of this bullshit would've happened.

216
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:57,879
Now look at them.

217
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,120
The family is destroyed,

218
00:11:59,679 --> 00:12:02,279
and the eldest son turned into a scoundrel—

219
00:12:02,799 --> 00:12:04,279
a hopeless case.

220
00:12:23,279 --> 00:12:24,120
Help me!

221
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:26,519
Help me!

222
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:27,559
Help...

223
00:12:28,879 --> 00:12:29,519
Save me!

224
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,519
I... I didn't say anything!

225
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:38,000
Here it comes, the final dish!

226
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:39,879
The ginger duck is ready.

227
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:40,960
Quite a feast today.

228
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,480
You could've let the servants make it.

229
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,559
How could their cooking beat mine?

230
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:47,039
Besides, you rarely come home.

231
00:12:47,399 --> 00:12:48,559
I wanted you to taste my cooking.

232
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:53,080
Here, have a taste.

233
00:12:54,799 --> 00:12:55,240
Go on.

234
00:12:55,799 --> 00:12:56,399
Thanks, Dad.

235
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:57,279
Eat up.

236
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:03,960
Delicious.

237
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:05,600
You know...

238
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:07,639
That murder at Sea Goddess Temple...

239
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:09,000
It's truly terrifying.

240
00:13:09,759 --> 00:13:10,879
You'd best stay out of it.

241
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:12,799
Stop taking grief at the police station, too.

242
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:14,759
Low pay, endless work, and risking your life.

243
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:17,720
Just quit your job.

244
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,879
The chamber of commerce needs an executive director.

245
00:13:20,159 --> 00:13:21,159
You'd be perfect to take the spot.

246
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:22,879
Dad...

247
00:13:23,639 --> 00:13:24,399
Let's just eat first.

248
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:30,600
Master!

249
00:13:31,879 --> 00:13:32,360
What happened?

250
00:13:32,679 --> 00:13:34,440
Wan Jun... Wan Jun killed himself!

251
00:13:49,639 --> 00:13:50,360
The deceased is male,

252
00:13:50,759 --> 00:13:51,600
around 25 years old.

253
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:52,840
Cause of death is

254
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,519
asphyxiation caused by a neck ligature.

255
00:13:55,399 --> 00:13:56,559
There is dried blood under his fingernails,

256
00:13:56,879 --> 00:13:57,840
matching the scratches on his face.

257
00:13:58,480 --> 00:14:00,360
The wall's bloodstain matches his forehead wound.

258
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,320
He clearly suffered severe withdrawal before dying.

259
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,720
Could it be homicide?

260
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,600
One criterion distinguishing suicide from homicide

261
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:09,320
is the presence of external trauma or struggle.

262
00:14:09,759 --> 00:14:11,360
The victim self-harmed during withdrawal,

263
00:14:11,799 --> 00:14:13,240
so it cannot serve as evidence of homicide.

264
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,399
Have him sent back to Village Chief Wan's house.

265
00:14:20,399 --> 00:14:21,159
Tell them the truth.

266
00:14:21,799 --> 00:14:22,399
Yes, Master.

267
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:26,759
Brother Mingyuan, what do you want to be when you grow up?

268
00:14:28,039 --> 00:14:30,039
I want to be a police officer when I grow up.

269
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:31,960
Wan Jun, what do you want to be when you grow up?

270
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:33,279
I want to make a lot of money

271
00:14:33,279 --> 00:14:34,960
and give my whole family a good life.

272
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:49,840
Li Mingyuan!

273
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:54,799
The police station is your turf, right?

274
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,080
I had you bring him back

275
00:14:57,519 --> 00:14:59,120
to keep him safe!

276
00:14:59,279 --> 00:15:00,399
Do you have any idea?!

277
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:01,919
Stop!

278
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:03,080
Wan Jun killed himself!

279
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:04,080
Why are you hitting my mentor?!

280
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:10,080
I'll find out the truth.

281
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:11,759
And whoever harmed him...

282
00:15:11,759 --> 00:15:12,720
I won't spare a single one!

283
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:42,320
Boss Wang, how does it feel?

284
00:15:43,639 --> 00:15:45,320
Incredible!

285
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:49,120
And about this...

286
00:15:58,519 --> 00:15:59,200
Here you go.

287
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:04,320
Boss Wang, so generous!

288
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:09,519
Your boss is really something.

289
00:16:11,039 --> 00:16:14,440
Where'd he get such good stuff?

290
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:21,159
I'd like to talk business with your boss.

291
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:26,879
The big boss doesn't meet outsiders easily.

292
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:28,919
Come on...

293
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:36,200
Am I an outsider?

294
00:16:41,399 --> 00:16:43,519
One of our own, strictly one of our own!

295
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:49,799
Once the deal is done,

296
00:16:51,759 --> 00:16:54,240
there'll be plenty in it for you.

297
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,039
You got it!

298
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:14,079
Why is Lian Ye here in disguise?

299
00:17:15,119 --> 00:17:15,599
This is bad.

300
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:18,720
We have to hurry.

301
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:39,559
Greetings, Big Boss.

302
00:17:40,279 --> 00:17:41,079
I'm Wang Ye.

303
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:54,119
Boss Song told me

304
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:56,319
you want to make a big deal with me.

305
00:17:58,599 --> 00:17:59,880
I heard the Big Boss here

306
00:18:01,559 --> 00:18:03,000
has goods of the finest quality.

307
00:18:04,400 --> 00:18:07,680
I'd like to order a shipment from you.

308
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:13,279
How much do you want,

309
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:14,759
and how much are you willing to pay?

310
00:18:15,359 --> 00:18:16,200
100 piculs.

311
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:18,200
300,000 silver dollars.

312
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:20,200
300,000?

313
00:18:21,079 --> 00:18:22,680
Then you won't make much profit.

314
00:18:23,039 --> 00:18:23,920
I don't want money.

315
00:18:24,799 --> 00:18:25,599
Not money?

316
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:27,960
Not money?

317
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:29,680
Then what do you want?

318
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,000
I want...

319
00:18:32,759 --> 00:18:33,400
your life.

320
00:18:33,799 --> 00:18:35,000
Boss Wang...

321
00:18:35,519 --> 00:18:36,680
You can't joke around like this.

322
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:37,720
What are you doing?

323
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,720
I've never crossed you!

324
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:41,680
Put... Put that away!

325
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:42,920
Put it away!

326
00:18:51,279 --> 00:18:52,160
Lian Ye!

327
00:18:52,319 --> 00:18:52,759
Speak!

328
00:18:54,480 --> 00:18:56,400
Why the hell did you murder my family?

329
00:18:57,400 --> 00:18:58,960
I... I didn't!

330
00:18:59,359 --> 00:19:00,400
I really didn't!

331
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:02,480
I didn't! I didn't!

332
00:19:02,599 --> 00:19:03,559
I swear I didn't!

333
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:06,960
Out of my way!

334
00:19:09,519 --> 00:19:10,119
Lian Ye, stop!

335
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:11,519
He murdered my family!
